\pard\b\fs28 The Cry Of The Poor\b0\fs22\par
\par
The Lord hears the cry of the poor\par
Blessed be the Lord.\par
\par
I will bless the Lord at all times\par
With praise ever in my mouth\par
Let my soul glory in the Lord\par
Who will hear the cry of the poor.\par
\par
The Lord hears the cry of the poor\par
Blessed be the Lord.\par
\par
We proclaim your greatness, O God\par
Your praise ever in our mouth\par
Every face brighten in Your light\par
For You hear the cry of the poor.\par
\par
The Lord hears the cry of the poor\par
Blessed be the Lord.\par
}